@startuml
title 异常处理包图

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei

package "异常处理包" as EX {
  package "统一异常处理\ncommon" as HANDLER {
    [GlobalExceptionHandler]
    [Result]
    [StatusCode]
  }

  package "业务异常来源\ncontroller / service" as SOURCE {
    [参数校验异常]
    [业务规则异常]
    [状态转换异常]
    [运行时异常]
  }

  package "框架异常类型\nSpring / Java" as TYPES {
    [MethodArgumentNotValidException]
    [IllegalArgumentException]
    [IllegalStateException]
    [Exception]
  }

  package "日志与横切\naspect / logback" as LOG {
    [OperationLogAspect]
    [logback-spring.xml]
  }
}

SOURCE ..> TYPES : 抛出异常
TYPES --> HANDLER : 统一捕获
HANDLER --> Result : 封装响应
HANDLER ..> StatusCode : 返回状态码
HANDLER ..> LOG : 记录异常日志

note right of EX
职责：
1. 对参数错误、业务错误和系统错误进行统一拦截
2. 返回统一响应结构，避免前端分散处理
3. 结合日志切面记录异常上下文，便于排查
end note

@enduml
